{"id":"e382a4415fd419dc","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point.md","title":"说谎者在极小一致固定点中是间隙","display":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 说谎者在极小一致固定点中是间隙","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point","91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal"],"display":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 说谎者在极小一致固定点中是间隙","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-lem-gap-sentence-property]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point</span><span>91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 说谎者在极小一致固定点中是间隙"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"965681a90864b053\" href=\"?note=965681a90864b053\" title=\"91-lem-gap-sentence-property\">91-lem-gap-sentence-property</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n(说谎者句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\)</span> (从空集迭代得到的极小一致固定点)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在空信息阶段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与其否定都未定，\n故对角句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\neg\\lambda\\)</span> 也都未定；这一状态在每个后继与\n极限阶段保持。因此从空信息出发的强 Kleene 迭代不会加入二者的编码。</p>\n<p>这是关于特定语义模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> 的结论。裸 KF 描述强 Kleene\n固定点的一般性质，并不把真理谓词唯一刻画为极小固定点；它还可能有\n非极小乃至含 glut 的模型。因此不能仅凭本推论把“极小模型中无真值”\n与“在 KF 中的四种不可证性”直接等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-gap-sentence-property","status":"resolved","id":"965681a90864b053","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-sentence-property]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\Gamma_{\\min}=\\operatorname{lfp}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false}],"bytes":1845,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cac035693aea2791","460308c7099a8386","965681a90864b053"]}